{"ID":"20260205093254-fp7230n","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-fp7230n","title":"5_AlexNet","type":"doc","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-7hi7nmb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-7hi7nmb","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"# "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-lvn1vxx","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-lvn1vxx","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-kch5fqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-kch5fqv","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[!NOTE]"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-utqh1kt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-utqh1kt","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神经网络是美国学者"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Alex Krizhevsky"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"于2012年在论文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ImageNet classification with deep convolutional neural networks"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中提出的。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-9p9z5c8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-9p9z5c8","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该方法的提出在当时乃至现在都是具有里程碑意义的，他是当前卷积神经网络的基本范式，同时也是该网络开创了通过加深神经网络来实现精度的提升；也是它将非线性激活函数"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ReLU"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"函数第一次提出并引入，同时采用了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"DropOut"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"机制来防止出现过拟合的问题。是当时深度最深，计算量最大，模型参数最多的神经网络模型，并赢下了当时的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ImageNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比赛。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-97zko8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-97zko8w","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虽然模型的架构已经非常的老，但是仍然由很多值得学习的地方。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-s2r2yih","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-s2r2yih","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 模型背景"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-xw5iahi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-xw5iahi","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1998"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Tann LeCun"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等人提出了卷积神经网络的奠基之作"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"LeNet-5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模型之后卷积神经网络就进入了历史的寒冬。大概整整10年都没有出现特别先进的思想特别厉害的算法来对卷积深度学习进行改进。直到斯坦福大学的教授李飞飞用了许多年的时间和他的同学们一起做成了当时最大最强的数据集"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ImageNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数据集并开源在网络之上，卷积神经网络又进入了一次新的热潮，其中最先跳脱而出的便是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-chc0vxp","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-chc0vxp","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-f978ndh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-f978ndh","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ImageNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数据集有大概"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1400"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多万张图片， 超过"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"万多种分类，是当时最大的数据集，没有之一"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-nkj92kz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-nkj92kz","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当时比较出名的卷积神经网路就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"LeNet-5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神经网络。如下图所示。然而该"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"LeNet-5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神经网络的训练精度在ImageNet上的过低。因此就需要尽可能的提升精度，但是现在的提升精度的方法并不多，人们只有猛拉深度这种办法了。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-eie0rkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-eie0rkj","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260118185747907"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260118185750677-1827904293.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-iho2o2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-iho2o2z","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对此AlexNet就沿用了猛拉深度的思想，采用了八层网络架构来实现这个模型。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-gf4opck","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-gf4opck","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-0ivfdla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-0ivfdla","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么人家不用超深的网络呢，实际上哈经济基础决定上层建筑，当时的GPU性能很低，就连AlexNet我们现在认为特别不行的模块都需要训练整整三天而且用了两个GPU才完成的。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-57pirsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-57pirsn","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可见技术的发展并不仅仅是软件算法的层面更是工业以及硬件等的整体提升。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-gmc0hhb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-gmc0hhb","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"论文的引言部分也说到：\"最后，网络的大小主要受到当前"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"GPU"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上可用内存量以及我们愿意容忍的训练时间的限制。 我们的网络需要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"6"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天的时间在两个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"GTX 580 3GB GPU"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上进行训练。 我们所有的实验都表明，只需等待更快"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"GPU"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和更大的数据集可用，我们的结果就可以得到改善\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-tvrmy16","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-tvrmy16","updated":"20260205093254"}},{"ID":"20260205093254-slcde5w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-slcde5w","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2 模型结构"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-0gm5l4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-0gm5l4y","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为了提高训练的精度"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用了当时最大的深度，整整使用了八层进行训练。其中包括五个卷积层以及三个线性层。如下图所示。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-excaxw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-excaxw5","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260119215534053"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260119215536103-462733085.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-un2ye7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-un2ye7b","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不知道大家有没有发现，这个网络结构的上半部分好像被截断了，感觉像是截图的有些问题一样。实际上并非如此，如此绘制是由它自己的一些想法的。当时的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"GPU"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"算例较低，因此只可以进行双"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"GPU"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"训练的方式，那么两个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"GPU"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"训练自然就与两个通道啦。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-vdf7tpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-vdf7tpz","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么根据这个图片我们就可以使用自己的语言来说一下他整体的结构框架。该模型总共包括了八层，其中有五个卷积层和三个线性层："}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-x6i7ejr","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-x6i7ejr","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-3rng7hy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-3rng7hy","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个网络架构主要基于"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ImageNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数据集的，该数据集的图片大小是三通道彩色图片。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-sjd9lw4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-sjd9lw4","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-7me2zok","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"1.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-7me2zok","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-bjxwwe6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-bjxwwe6","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该层卷积的卷积核大小为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"11"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，步长为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，填充为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。并且总共有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"96"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"个卷积核。实现下采样的功能。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-7l169fx","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"2.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":2,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-7l169fx","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-lzb96j4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-lzb96j4","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该层卷积的卷积核大小为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，步长为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，填充为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":".并且总共有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"256"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"个卷积核。实现特征的提取。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-tjmpf70","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"3.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":3,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-tjmpf70","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-da9cord","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-da9cord","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该层卷积的卷积核大小为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，步长为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，填充为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，并且总共有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"384"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"个卷积核。实现特征的提取。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-ftrd5id","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"4.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":4,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-ftrd5id","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-4sa3t30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-4sa3t30","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该层卷积的卷积核大小为3，步长为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，填充为1，并且总共有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"384"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"个卷积核。实现特征的提取。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-5uxtms8","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"5.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":5,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-5uxtms8","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-lter2js","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-lter2js","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该层卷积的卷积核大小为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，步长为1，填充为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，并且总共有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"256"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"个卷积核。实现特征的提取。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-3oxcspd","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"6.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":6,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-3oxcspd","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-x2xv0bz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-x2xv0bz","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该线性层的输入数据为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"256\\times 6\\times 6"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，输出数据为2048。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-jcxaclj","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"7.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":7,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-jcxaclj","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-kgps01i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-kgps01i","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该线性层的输入数据为2048，输出数据为2048。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-y7u51mb","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"8.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":8,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"OC4=","Num":8},"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-y7u51mb","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-pvzi9zh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-pvzi9zh","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该线性层的输入数据为2048，输出数据为1000。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-9tdktqx","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-9tdktqx","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-ncuobxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-ncuobxh","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[!CAUTION]"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-l9fd9qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-l9fd9qz","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意，上面的*(1，2)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"层卷积层后面需要更上一组最大池化层"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MaxPool*，最大池化层的参数在论文的4.4节提到，采用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"kernel=3，stride=2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的池化方式。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-8gs1131","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-8gs1131","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其次在进入线性层之前，需要引入"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"DropOut"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"机制函数，尽可能避免出现过拟合的情况出现。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-487tlt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-487tlt3","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后在网络结构这里，我们还需要站在当时的角度来看看这篇文章在当时最强的地方是什么："},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们认为他最强的地方莫过于提出了一种非线性函数作为激活函数"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"ReLU=max(0,x)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个函数长得非常的简单。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-pnsnfc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-pnsnfc6","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260120094410597"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260120094414990-1417576373.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-osm3mew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-osm3mew","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大道至简，这个函数成为现在最常用的激活函数没有之一！"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-b2djo9m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-b2djo9m","updated":"20260205093254"}},{"ID":"20260205093254-vc5x0jc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-vc5x0jc","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3 模型框架代码"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-j5btowu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-j5btowu","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么单个GPU的网络架构如下图所示。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-qpn5oct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-qpn5oct","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260120095705594"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260120095709283-1409704673.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-rr9jy8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-rr9jy8t","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有了这个架构我们就可以进行AlexNet的代码编程。这里主要使用的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Pytorch"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"框架进行撰写"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-8ape5xc","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-8ape5xc","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport numpy as np\nimport torchvision \nfrom torchvision import transforms, datasets\nimport torch.optim as optim\nimport time\nfrom tqdm import tqdm\nimport os\nfrom torch.cuda.amp import autocast, GradScaler\n\nclass AlexNet(nn.Module):\n    '''AlexNet 神经网络模块,这里就不再分两个GPU训练了,直接写在单个GPU上面进行训练\n    '''\n    def __init__(self , num_classes= 20):\n        super(AlexNet , self).__init__()\n        # input size = 224*224*3\n        self.Conv1 = nn.Conv2d(in_channels = 3 , out_channels = 96 , kernel_size = 11 , stride = 4 , padding = 2)\n        self.Relu1 = nn.ReLU(inplace=True)\n        self.maxpool1 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=3 , stride = 2) \n\n        # input size = 27*27*96\n        self.Conv2 = nn.Conv2d(in_channels = 96 , out_channels = 256 , kernel_size=5 , stride=1 , padding = 2)\n        self.Relu2 = nn.ReLU(inplace=True)\n        self.maxpool2 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size = 3 , stride = 2)\n\n        # input size = 13*13*256\n        self.Conv3 = nn.Conv2d(in_channels = 256 , out_channels = 192*2 , kernel_size= 3 , stride = 1 , padding = 1)\n        self.Relu3 = nn.ReLU(inplace=True)\n\n        # input size = 13*13*384\n        self.Conv4 = nn.Conv2d(in_channels = 384 , out_channels=384 , kernel_size = 3 , stride=1 , padding=1)\n        self.Relu4 = nn.ReLU(inplace=True)\n\n        # input size = 13*13*384\n        self.Conv5 = nn.Conv2d(in_channels = 384 , out_channels =256 , kernel_size = 3 , stride = 1 , padding = 1)\n        self.Relu5 = nn.ReLU(inplace=True)\n        self.maxpool3 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size = 3 , stride = 2)\n\n        self.avgpool = nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d((6,6))\n\n\n        # input size = 6*6*256\n        self.dropout1 = nn.Dropout(p=0.5)\n        self.fc1 = nn.Linear(in_features = 256*6*6 , out_features=2048 , bias = True)\n        self.Relu6 = nn.ReLU(inplace=True)\n\n        # input size = 2048\n        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(in_features=2048 , out_features=2048 , bias = True) \n        self.Relu7 = nn.ReLU(inplace=True)\n\n        self.dropout2 = nn.Dropout(p=0.5)\n\n        # input size = 2048\n        self.fc3 = nn.Linear(in_features=2048 , out_features=num_classes , bias = True)\n        self.Softmax = nn.Softmax(dim=1)\n\n    def forward(self , x):\n        x = self.Conv1(x)\n        x = self.Relu1(x)\n        x = self.maxpool1(x)\n\n        x = self.Conv2(x)\n        x = self.Relu2(x)\n        x = self.maxpool2(x)\n\n        x = self.Conv3(x)\n        x = self.Relu3(x)\n\n        x = self.Conv4(x)\n        x = self.Relu4(x)\n\n        x = self.Conv5(x)\n        x = self.Relu5(x)\n        x = self.maxpool3(x)\n\n        x = self.avgpool(x)\n\n        x = self.dropout1(x)\n\n        x = x.view(x.size(0) , -1)\n\n        x = self.fc1(x)\n        x = self.Relu6(x)\n\n        x = self.fc2(x)\n        x = self.Relu7(x)\n\n        x = self.dropout2(x)\n\n        x = self.fc3(x)\n\n        return x\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]}]}